{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"漏掉了他一度喜欢得快藏不住、还想进一步靠近，却最终收住的情绪推进。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把‘开始觉得对方也需要自己’强化成‘第一次认真感受到’，原文没有第一次的限定；另外没有拼出感受中带情色意味的身体暖意和失去方向感。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"没有拼出这份灵动中的调情意味，以及快乐余温逐渐转为怀念的情绪变化。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"将感受概括为‘满足、坦然’不够准确。原文的情绪并非安然满足，而是仍然渴望更多，快乐强烈到喉咙发紧、难以平复。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"没有充分拼出幸福与苦涩同时存在的状态。原文不是幸福已经过去，而是幸福仍在，却已经掺进了苦涩。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"}\n  ],\n  \"story\":3,\n  \"story_note\":\"全曲的关系发展、情感变化和最终选择基本都拼对了，但‘此刻能够相爱’把原文没有确认的双向爱情说成了既定事实；原文确认的是亲近与单方面喜欢，以及对方可能也需要这份陪伴。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "707e442a-0631-4154-a096-2179638adef4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T200133306780Z", "elapsed_seconds": 179.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:04:32.709128+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c43ba5c1af58bae15ac25b4b47a5c665c24e1fda375714b1b7d02db580fba9e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true